     "soort": "alinea",
     "tekst": "• Appropriate engineering controls No further data; see item 7. • Individual protection measures, such as personal protective equipment • General protective and hygienic measures: Keep away from foodstuffs, beverages and feed. Immediately remove all soiled and contaminated clothing Wash hands before breaks and at the end of work. Avoid contact with the eyes and skin. • Respiratory protection: In case of brief exposure or low pollution use respiratory filter device. In case of intensive or longer exposure use self-contained respiratory protective device. • Hand protection"
